codex
The root cause is confirmed: the sandbox’s PID namespace makes Lean query a nonexistent `/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe`, while `/proc/self/exe` is valid. I added a narrow preload shim that only retries that failed application-path lookup; it does not alter files, commands, theorem checking, or exit statuses. Lean now identifies the exact pinned 4.22.0 commit, so I’m rerunning the unmodified trusted `check_generation` with that compatibility layer.
